abstract: >
  Rieke Lab OS provides local recording catalogs, metadata search, hierarchical
  epoch browsing, authored annotations, reproducible selections, and exports
  for MATLAB and SQLite analysis. Includes the EpicTreeGUI MATLAB integration.
